    "title": "Hope Mills driver yelled 'You better run' before hitting teen, police say - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WRAL staff ,\n6 hours ago A driver in Hope Mills screamed, “You better run,” as he sped toward a teen. The driver then hit the teen with his vehicle and fled the scene. The mother of the teen told WRAL that her son got off the bus and was on his phone when he heard a car door close. She said her son told her he then heard Bharrat rev his engine before hitting him and a mailbox. Read full article\n9",
